OL,3,GNEWSAAir India crash relatives write to
OL,4,ADowning Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose parents were killed
OL,7,Falongside 51 other British citizens in
OL,8,Fthe Air India plane crash has urged
OL,9,FDowning Street to act following the
OL,10,F"catastrophic handling" of the
OL,11,Fincident.
OL,13,FAshok and Shobhana Patel were among the
OL,14,F260 people who died when the plane
OL,15,Fcrashed shortly after it left Ahmedabad
OL,16,FAirport, western India, for Gatwick on
OL,17,F12 June 2025. One passenger survived.
OL,19,FAfter his parents' remains returned to
OL,20,Fthe UK, Miten Patel was told his
OL,21,Fmother's casket also contained someone
OL,22,Felse's remains.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
